r. About 350 words. Let's draft around 350. Need count. Let's write with placeholders: [Date], [Vendor Contact Name], [Vendor Company Name], [Your Name], [Your Company Name]? Company name is a name. Maybe [Your Company Name] is placeholder for name. But user says from a small software company; could use [Company Name]. Need only names and dates placeholders. So no [GPU Model], [Program Name]. Use \"your upcoming GPU\" and \"developer program\".\n\nNeed ensure word count about 350. Let's draft and count.\n\nDear [Vendor Contact Name],\n\nI am writing on behalf of [Company Name], a small software company that develops an open-source inference engine for deploying machine learning models on heterogeneous hardware. Our engine is designed to provide a lightweight, portable runtime for inference workloads, with particular attention to performance, memory efficiency, and ease of integration for developers who build applications on emerging accelerators.\n\nWe are requesting early access to your developer program for your upcoming GPU. Access before launch would allow our team to begin driver, runtime, and compiler-level integration while the hardware is still in the pre-release phase. Because our engine is open source, early integration would also help us identify compatibility issues, optimize kernel execution paths, and provide feedback that can improve the developer experience for a broader community.\n\n", "top2": [[[1596, -0.0018714882899075747], [1421, -7.130136966705322]], [[1144, -1.0371261851105373e-05], [1902, -12.143982887268066]], [[310, -0.43670010566711426], [4087, -1.1261951923370361]], [[5707, -0.7844830751419067], [4087, -1.0102216005325317]], [[310, -5.245222382654902e-06], [303, -12.754765510559082]], [[1156, -1.9073504518019035e-06], [6163, -14.156646728515625]], [[25, -0.010902252979576588], [9859, -5.071739196777344]], [[328, -0.06647973507642746], [9357, -2.9311342239379883]], [[7734, -3.2663880119798705e-05], [2523, -10.98359489440918]], [[264, -3.4